&lt;li style=&quot;font-family: helvetica, arial, sans-serif; font-size: 12pt;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 12pt;&quot;&gt;&lt;sup&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family: helvetica, arial, sans-serif;&quot;&gt;Equip Sales across enterprise and product-led motions with the messaging, training, and material that compresses cycles and lifts win rates&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/sup&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
