&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 12pt;&quot;&gt;&lt;sup&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family: helvetica, arial, sans-serif;&quot;&gt;Customer Evidence, Market Intel &amp;amp; Voice of the Customer&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/sup&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
