&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 12pt;&quot;&gt;&lt;sup&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family: helvetica, arial, sans-serif;&quot;&gt;AI-Fluent Marketing&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/sup&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-family: helvetica, arial, sans-serif; font-size: 12pt;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 12pt;&quot;&gt;&lt;sup&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family: helvetica, arial, sans-serif;&quot;&gt;AI fluency is required. Daily AI tool use is the baseline; building with AI is the bar. PolyAI is the place to become the best builder version of yourself, with the company supporting through real tools and real tokens. In this role, you will:&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/sup&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-family: helvetica, arial, sans-serif; font-size: 12pt;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 12pt;&quot;&gt;&lt;sup&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family: helvetica, arial, sans-serif;&quot;&gt;Operate AI-first. Prototype before you brief, work alongside your agents from the first idea, and publish rather than send. The distance between idea and artifact should be close to zero.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/sup&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-family: helvetica, arial, sans-serif; font-size: 12pt;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 12pt;&quot;&gt;&lt;sup&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family: helvetica, arial, sans-serif;&quot;&gt;Build the systems, not just the artifacts. Where the work is repeatable, build the agents and workflows that produce it.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/sup&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-family: helvetica, arial, sans-serif; font-size: 12pt;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 12pt;&quot;&gt;&lt;sup&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family: helvetica, arial, sans-serif;&quot;&gt;Publish what you build weekly. Your tools and workflows are reusable by the rest of the team and the company. You’re not just delivering campaigns; you’re publishing the agents and templates other teams self-serve from.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/sup&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-family: helvetica, arial, sans-serif; font-size: 12pt;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 12pt;&quot;&gt;&lt;sup&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family: helvetica, arial, sans-serif;&quot;&gt;Lead the cadence of model and product releases. Own the rhythm of bringing new capabilities to market end-to-end, from product conversation to launch kit, on a tempo the market can feel.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/sup&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-family: helvetica, arial, sans-serif; font-size: 12pt;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 12pt;&quot;&gt;&lt;sup&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family: helvetica, arial, sans-serif;&quot;&gt;Tell your story in the market. How you use AI to do the work, what you’ve built, and the portfolio of agents and launches you carry with you. Marketing your own portfolio externally is part of the job.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/sup&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
